    "idleFormula": "For i=0..3, pos=min(abs(i-1),2)/2; add sin(t)*3*pos to wing Y; add -sin(t)*5*pos to feather Y. t advances .035 per game tick.",
    "liftFormula": "For i=0..3, pos=min(abs(i-1),2)/2; cycle=t-pos*1.2; x=(sin(cycle+pi/2)-1)/2*16+8; y=(sin(cycle)*26+12)*(1-pos*(min(sin(cycle+pi),0)/2+1)*sin(t)); add [x,y,0] to restWingDegrees[i], feathers=restFeatherDegrees. t advance lerps .375 to .225 over first100ticks.",
    "glideFormula": "For i=0..3, pos=min(abs(i-1),2)/2; add [0,(sin(t)*5-14)*pos,0] to restWingDegrees[i]. Upstream adds subtle feather X noise; preview may hold feather rest. t advances .045 per tick."
  },
